      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "STEP 1: Small / Pre-sorted?\nInsertion Sort\n- Input: n <= 30 or near-sorted\n- Best: O(n) | Space: O(1)\n- Stable | Near-zero overhead",
      "originalText": "STEP 1: Small / Pre-sorted?\nInsertion Sort\n- Input: n <= 30 or near-sorted\n- Best: O(n) | Space: O(1)\n- Stable | Near-zero overhead",
